{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/7708097dadeb9cbd8d9796b557b6b57c.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story takes place in the year 2997. You play as Apranik. Your mission is to travel to the planet Thulcandra in search of a crucial item: the Angel\u2019s Egg, a very ancient artifact believed to be the source of all life in the Universe.  You journey through the claustrophobic corridors of a massive underground complex filled with the remnants of technological and biological horrors created by a now dead civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What I witnessed could not be described. It seemed instead a convergence of nameless states collapsing into what cannot be comprehended: flesh and bones writhing and weaving into a turmoil of organic anarchy, appendages propelling the aberration toward me as it crawled upon an onyx, mucus-like substance which itself seemed endowed with life.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/9a20ad52e414986886b463e57d1590f3.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/fbe6281275d160203c0906cceb9e4874.poster.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/fbe6281275d160203c0906cceb9e4874.webm?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/fbe6281275d160203c0906cceb9e4874.mp4?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Wield devastating melee and psychokinetic weapons to take down ruthless foes.<br>- Customize your survival through layered RPG systems and progression trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/03de7727b6155bacf93009b13c112b37.poster.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/03de7727b6155bacf93009b13c112b37.webm?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/03de7727b6155bacf93009b13c112b37.mp4?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Immerse in a deep, evocative story of rich lore and forbidden secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/ea5b785d9ed462f3377721b9fd003481.poster.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/ea5b785d9ed462f3377721b9fd003481.webm?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/ea5b785d9ed462f3377721b9fd003481.mp4?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Navigate a hostile sprawling underground complex in eerie, solitary isolation.<br>- Experience finely tuned mechanics built for exploration, immersion, and replay value. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/5c32a222695ffb5a9f4566ec54898fc1.poster.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/5c32a222695ffb5a9f4566ec54898fc1.webm?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/5c32a222695ffb5a9f4566ec54898fc1.mp4?t=1772806514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Shape dynamic environments that react to your actions and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Uncover ancient artifacts revealing the lost chronicles of a forgotten alien civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/extras/692653bc009f8df4cc25a4eefdc25d97.avif?t=1772806514\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2742920?t=1772806514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/29549740cacca8e81532d3db94ae9fcfa0577d95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772806514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742920/c41037212228ee9d7ea330861a3678dae466dc56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772806514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset